- arrow? no.
- flash overlay at impact.

Wait pile should maybe draw after character if pile is right side and independent; behind is fine.
Stump draw before character but axe swings in front. Character's body is left of stump; okay.
Flying log from stump to pile drawn after.

Background image drawn full W,H.

