Need make the horizon at groundY but trees behind. The ground should start at groundY - maybe a rolling hill a bit above.

Let me define horizon = groundY - 30*S? Character feet at groundY. Distant land at groundY-60. The clearing ground starts there. Use `horizon = groundY - 34*S`.

Sky to horizon.
