content.text:
CSS hint update. Replace `.hint` block and `.hint.is-gone`.

Current:
```
.hint {
  display:flex...
  margin: 0 0 13px;
  ...
}
.hint.is-gone { opacity.. transform translateY... margin-bottom 0; padding.. height 0...}
```
Change to absolute near top. Need z-index. Font 11. Add transition.
```
.hint {
 position:absolute; z-index:6; top: calc(env(safe-area-inset-top)+78px); left:50%;
 display:flex; ... margin:0; padding...
 transform: translateX(-50%);
 ...
}
.hint.is-gone { opacity:0; transform: translate(-50%,-8px); pointer-events:none; }
```
Remove height collapse. On mobile height <=700 top maybe 64px. Media query currently `.hint { margin-bottom: 8px; }` change to top adjustment.
Let's edit.

input.oldString:
.hint {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 7px;
  margin: 0 0 13px;
  padding: 6px 13px 6px 10px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 237, 200, .12);
  background: rgba(7, 19, 17, .35);
  box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, .18);
  backdrop-filter: blur(9px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(9px);
  font-size: 10.5px;
